# Scope — Plan 0001

> Add the core todo behavior one step at a time, so the run exercises a strictly sequential task graph.

## Why this plan

The first plan demonstrates Makina's default per-task workflow with a simple dependency chain: each task builds on the previous one, so the scheduler runs them one after another even though concurrency is configured higher.

## In scope

- **0001 — Todo Core.** Add a toggle, an open-task counter, and a summary line, each depending on the previous task.

## Out of scope

- Persistence, networking, and changes outside `src/main.rs`.